        "filing_date": "2026-01-29",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "As part of our business, we seek to protect the underlying intellectual property rights of these innovations and designs such as with respect to patents, trademarks, copyrights, trade secrets, confidential information and other measures, including through employee and third-party nondisclosure agreements and other contractual arrangements.",
        "start_character": 39378,
        "end_character": 39719
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-003952",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-003952-90d5d2bc4057df41",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-003952",
        "filing_date": "2026-01-29",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "At these facilities, we manufacture and assemble, among other things, vehicles, certain vehicle parts and components, such as our battery packs and battery cells, energy storage components and systems and solar products and components.",
        "start_character": 20317,
        "end_character": 20552
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-003952",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-003952-90d5d2bc4057df41",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-003952",
        "filing_date": "2026-01-29",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "By taking a modular approach to the design of battery systems, we can optimize manufacturing capacity of our energy storage products.",
        "start_character": 8641,
        "end_character": 8774
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-003952",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-003952-90d5d2bc4057df41",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-003952",
        "filing_date": "2026-01-29",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In 2026, we will be ramping six new production lines across vehicle, Bots, energy storage and battery manufacturing, while further leveraging our existing factory, charging and service center footprints to support future growth.",
        "start_character": 10580,
        "end_character": 10808
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-003952",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-003952-90d5d2bc4057df41",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-003952",
        "filing_date": "2026-01-29",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In order to enable a greater supply of cells for our products with higher energy density at lower costs, we have developed a new proprietary lithium-ion battery cell and improved manufacturing processes.",
        "start_character": 8260,
        "end_character": 8463
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-003952",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-003952-90d5d2bc4057df41",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-003952",
        "filing_date": "2026-01-29",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We also compete with solar energy companies that provide products and services similar to ours.",
        "start_character": 38682,
        "end_character": 38777
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-003952",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-003952-90d5d2bc4057df41",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-003952",
        "filing_date": "2026-01-29",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We also currently offer optional extended service plans that provide coverage after the new vehicle limited warranties end for certain models in specified regions.",
        "start_character": 17602,
        "end_character": 17765
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-003952",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-003952-90d5d2bc4057df41",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-003952",
        "filing_date": "2026-01-29",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We are focused on bringing artificial intelligence (“AI”) into the real world, through products and services like Full Self-Driving (“FSD”) (Supervised) and Robotaxi, as well as working to develop and commercialize AI robots (“Bots”) (including Optimus).",
        "start_character": 26,
        "end_character": 280
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-003952",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-003952-90d5d2bc4057df41",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-003952",
        "filing_date": "2026-01-29",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We design and manufacture certain components for our energy generation products, including solar panels and Solar Roof, which combines premium glass roof tiles with energy generation.",
        "start_character": 5245,
        "end_character": 5428
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-003952",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-003952-90d5d2bc4057df41",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-003952",
        "filing_date": "2026-01-29",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We designed both products to integrate with Powerwall.",
        "start_character": 9825,
        "end_character": 9879
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-003952",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-003952-90d5d2bc4057df41",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-003952",
        "filing_date": "2026-01-29",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We emphasize performance, attractive styling and the safety of our users and workforce in the design and manufacture of our products and are continuing to develop full self-driving technology for improved safety.",
        "start_character": 764,
        "end_character": 976
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-003952",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-003952-90d5d2bc4057df41",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-003952",
        "filing_date": "2026-01-29",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We expect our Robotaxi service to compete in this developing market, along with traditional ride-hailing and taxi services, through continued progress on our FSD (Supervised) and neural network capabilities, Supercharger network and infotainment offerings.",
